SUMMARY:The Australian Pink Floyd Show: The Happiest Days Of Our Lives - Greatest Hits 26
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $59 $69 $79 \nVIP Meet & Greet Package $192 \n\nOne premium reserved ticket\nEarly entry into the venue\nExclusive meet & greet with members of TAPFS\nGroup photograph with members of TAPFS\nLimited edition tour poster; autographed\nCustom TAPFS socks\nCommemorative ticket magnet\nSpecially designed TAPFS cinch bag\nOfficial meet & greet laminate & lanyard\nLimited availability\n\nThe Australian Pink Floyd Show is internationally recognized as the world’s premier Pink Floyd tribute\, delivering faithful\, note-for-note recreations of the band’s legendary music in a full-length live concert experience. Spanning Pink Floyd’s iconic catalogue\, the show captures the power\, precision\, and emotional depth of the original recordings and tours. \nBeyond the music\, audiences are immersed in a spectacular production featuring synchronized lighting\, lasers\, high-resolution video\, and signature visual elements inspired by Pink Floyd’s historic live performances. With decades of touring experience and a reputation for musical excellence\, The Australian Pink Floyd Show offers fans of all generations a breathtaking evening that celebrates the sound and spectacle of one of rock’s most influential bands. \n“Setting the gold standard” – The Times \n“For the record TAPFS are a phenomenon to be witnessed live… It’s almost enough to make you forget you haven’t been watching Pink Floyd\, but a surrogate band” – Prog  \n“Probably the most popular tribute band in the world” – Sunday Times ‘Culture’ \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance. \n 
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/the-australian-pink-floyd-show-the-happiest-days-of-our-lives-greatest-hits-26/
